#safira 0.9
# 🔮 Crystal ball

show "🔮 Ask the crystal ball a question:"
save the answer in question

list of fates receive "Yes!", "No way.", "Definitely.", "Ask again.", "The stars say maybe."
luck = a random number between 1 and 5

clear
show "You asked: %" inserting question
wait 1 seconds
show "🔮 " + list of fates in position luck in color purple
